# xTB relaxed scan of the nucleophilic attack O(OH-)...C(CO2).
# Use with the CO2-containing model (cut_cluster.py --add-co2 --co2-pdb 3D92.pdb,
# default water/Glu options): atom 2 = O of Zn-OH-, atom 52 = C of CO2.
# Check "REACTION COORDINATE" in build_co2/build_report.txt and edit if needed.
# The scan goes from 2.80 A to 1.50 A in 14 points; each point is a
# constrained optimisation (xTB scans are always relaxed scans).
# This is only a cheap preview: take the highest point as a guide, NOT as a TS.
$fix
   atoms: 9,21,33,40,49
$end
$constrain
   force constant=1.0
   distance: 2, 52, 2.80
$end
$scan
   1: 2.80, 1.50, 14
$end
